    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεισ-ρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flow</i> or <i>stream in</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰς
